        "text": "# Property\n\nA **property** is a named piece of information inside an object.\n\nIt tells you a specific fact about that object that your program can read or update.\n\nFor example, a backpack object includes properties such as `type: \"canvas\"`, `color: \"blue\"`, or `size: 30`.",
